@startuml Preciazo_Analytics_Engagement_Classes
title Preciazo - Analytics and Engagement Domain (AV2 - US27)
set namespaceSeparator none
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
class MetricEvent <<Aggregate>> {
 -id: Long
 -storeId: Long
 -type: MetricEventType
 -source: MetricSource
 -sourceKey: String
 -payloadFingerprint: String
 -actorId: Long [0..1]
 -promotionId: Long [0..1]
 -routeId: Long [0..1]
 -routeVersion: Long [0..1]
 -occurredAt: Instant
 -receivedAt: Instant
 +record(): void
}
enum MetricEventType {
 ROUTE_STOP_SUGGESTED
 PROMOTION_INTERACTED
}
enum MetricSource {
 ROUTE_PLANNING
 AUTHENTICATED_UI
}
class MetricSourceIdentity <<Value Object>> {
 -source: MetricSource {readOnly}
 -sourceKey: String {readOnly}
 -type: MetricEventType {readOnly}
 -storeId: Long {readOnly}
}
class MerchantMetrics <<Read Model>> {
 +storeId: Long
 +period: ReportingPeriod
 +routeSuggestionCount: Long
 +distinctPromotionUsers: Long
 +promotionMetrics: List<PromotionMetrics>
 +evaluatedAt: Instant
 +ingestionCoverage: IngestionCoverage
}
class PromotionMetrics <<Read Model>> {
 +promotionId: Long
 +interactionCount: Long
 +distinctUserCount: Long
 +period: ReportingPeriod
 +evaluatedAt: Instant
 +ingestionCoverage: IngestionCoverage
}
class ReportingPeriod <<Value Object>> {
 -month: YearMonth {readOnly}
 -timeZone: String {readOnly}
 -fromInclusive: Instant {readOnly}
 -toExclusive: Instant {readOnly}
 +contains(moment: Instant): Boolean
}
class MerchantReport <<Aggregate>> {
 -id: Long
 -storeId: Long
 -requestedBy: Long
 -requestKey: String
 -period: ReportingPeriod
 -routeSuggestionCount: Long
 -distinctPromotionUsers: Long
 -ingestionCoverage: IngestionCoverage
 -generatedAt: Instant
 +generate(metrics: MerchantMetrics): void
}
class PromotionReportRow <<Value Object>> {
 -promotionId: Long {readOnly}
 -interactionCount: Long {readOnly}
 -distinctUserCount: Long {readOnly}
}
enum IngestionCoverage {
 UNKNOWN
}
interface MetricsCalculator <<domain policy>> {
 +calculate(events: List<MetricEvent>, period: ReportingPeriod): MerchantMetrics
}
MetricEvent --> MetricSourceIdentity : deduplication identity
MetricEvent ..> MetricEventType
MetricEvent ..> MetricSource
MerchantMetrics "1" --> "1" ReportingPeriod
MerchantMetrics "1" *-- "0..*" PromotionMetrics
MerchantReport "1" --> "1" ReportingPeriod
MerchantReport "1" *-- "0..*" PromotionReportRow
MerchantReport ..> MerchantMetrics : freezes observed values
MetricsCalculator ..> MetricEvent
MetricsCalculator ..> MerchantMetrics
MerchantMetrics ..> IngestionCoverage
note bottom of MetricEvent
 Immutable accepted observation; no update/delete command.
 UNIQUE(source, source_key, event_type, store_id).
 Same key + same semantic payload: return original id, no new event.
 Same key + changed payload: conflict; enforce atomically under concurrency.
 Promotion requires actor + promotion; route requires route id + version.
 Source, store, actor and occurrence time are validated by the server.
end note
note bottom of MetricsCalculator
 Count each selected store once per saved route optimization version.
 A successful replan is another suggestion; confirmation/read/retry is not.
 Promotion users = COUNT DISTINCT actor_id, not number of requests.
 Store-level users are distinct across promotions, never summed per promotion.
 Month uses store time zone, with half-open UTC boundaries [from, to).
 No inferred store visits, lost sales, purchases or engagement score.
end note
note bottom of MerchantReport
 Immutable US27 summary, generated by the merchant owner.
 Capture all counts in one consistent database snapshot.
 Later observations may change live metrics, never the saved report.
 No durable delivery or complete ingestion guarantee is implied.
end note
note bottom of MerchantMetrics
 Observed counts only; zero means no accepted observations in this period.
 UNKNOWN coverage remains explicit until source delivery is specified.
 Current promotion status does not erase earlier valid interactions.
end note
@enduml
